ak we heard in the  last question an important message that  those of us from the developed world  must hear during this conference Carl  Sagan said during his address the issue  of the global environment is linked to  the issue of poverty interdependence is  one of the themes we will be discussing  the second point in closing is we want  to begin our sessions this week promptly  at the hour indicated  in the program tomorrow morning for  example 8:30 a.m. means 8:30 a.m. please  be on time because we will begin at 8:30  a.m. thank you all very much and join me  in thanking Carl Sagan again for a  wonderful speech Thank You Carl
 

